{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And the firstborn of your herd.</b> He who is fit to eat them shall eat them, as I explained." "<b>So that you may learn.</b> The meaning: for when you go to the place of glory, there they will teach you. A second reason for \"so that you may learn\" is like the meaning of עגלה מלומדה (a trained heifer), and the meaning is habituation, and this is upright in my eyes."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:23:24.983461960Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}